{"id":"P046-2","subject":"P","unit":"P046","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P046-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n경간이 300m인 330mm ACSR선의 이도가 6m이다.\n\n이도를 9m로 늘리기 위해 추가로 필요한 전선의 길이는\n\n몇 m인가?\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.3\n\n③ 0.4          ④ 0.5\n\n⑤ 0.6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":602},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":618},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m26-e2.webp","width":696,"height":914}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음의 전력케이블 시설 방법 중에서, 시설 방법이 다른\n\n하나는?\n\n\n① 열 발산이 크고, 송전용량이 크다.\n\n② 많은 회선을 부설할 수 있다.\n\n③ 증설이 어렵고, 고장점을 찾기가 어렵다.\n\n④ 유지 및 보수가 어렵다.\n\n⑤ 사고 복구에 장시간 소요된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":970},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m27-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1332}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n선간전압이 66kV이고, 1상당의 리액턴스가 12Ω인\n\n기기에 있어서 기준용량 16.5MVA 에 대한 %리액턴스는\n\n몇 인가?\n\n\n① 2.4          ② 3.6\n\n③ 4.5          ④ 5.6\n\n⑤ 7.2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":552}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n다음의 코로나 임계전압의 수식에서, 각 요소에 대한\n\n설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n                           kV           log\n\n\n① 전선 표면계수(잘 다듬어진 단선은 1, 표면이\n\n  거친 단선은 0.93~0.98)\n② 날씨 계수(우천시 1, 맑은 날 0.8)\n\n③ 상대공기밀도(표준대기압 760mmHg, 표준기온\n\n  20°C에서 1)\n\n④ 전선의 반지름(클수록 코로나 임계전압이 커진다.)\n\n⑤ 등가선간거리(클수록 코로나 임계전압이 커진다.)","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1137}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n3상 선로의 수전단 전압이 60kV, 전류는 200A , 선로\n\n의 저항 및 리액턴스가 5Ω, 10Ω일 때, 전압강하율은\n\n몇 인가? (단, 수전단 역률은 지상 0.8이다.)\n\n\n① 2.4          ② 3.2\n\n③ 4.8          ④ 5.8\n\n⑤ 6.9","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":745},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m30-e2.webp","width":678,"height":555}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n다음의 설명에 해당하는 접지 방식은?\n\n   ⦁1선 지락시 건전상의 전위상승이 거의 없다.\n\n   ⦁선로 및 기기의 절연레벨을 낮출 수 있다.\n\n   ⦁변압기의 단절연이 가능하다.\n\n   ⦁보호계전기의 동작히 확실하다.\n\n   ⦁1선 지락시 지락전류가 매우 크다.\n\n\n① 직접접지 방식     ② 비접지 방식\n\n③ 고저항접지 방식    ④ 저저항접지방식\n\n⑤ 소호리액터접지 방식","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":742},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1329}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n통신선측의 전자유도 장해 경감대책으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 선로의 병행길이를 단축시킨다.\n\n② 피뢰기를 설치한다.\n\n③ 연피 통신 케이블을 사용한다.\n\n④ 배류코일, 중화코일을 사용한다.\n\n⑤ 고저항 접지를 시행한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":538},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1244}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n전력 원선도로부터 알 수 없는 것은?\n\n\n① 송수전 가능한 최대전력\n\n② 선로 손실 및 코로나 손실\n\n③ 필요한 전력을 보내기 위한 송수전단 전압간의 상차각\n\n④ 수전단 역률(무효전력 조정 후의 역률)\n\n⑤ 필요한 조상설비의 용량","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":638}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n유효낙차가 100m이고, 사용 평균 유량이 30ms인\n\n수차 발전기의 최대출력은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 수차효율 90, 발전기 효율 90이다.)\n\n\n① 23814        ② 26460\n\n③ 29400        ④ 32667\n\n⑤ 36296","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":687},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":618}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n다음이 설명하는 장치는?\n\n 배기가스에 남아있는 여열을 이용하여 보일로 급수를\n\n  가열(예열)하는 장치로, 보일러의 효율을 높이는 역할을\n\n  한다.\n\n\n\n① 과열기        ② 절탄기\n\n③ 공기예열기      ④ 급수가열기\n\n⑤ 재열기","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":553},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1264},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m35-e2.webp","width":696,"height":750}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n                 벡터가                      로 주어질\n            \n                     때, (1, 1, 4)에서 벡터 의 단위 벡터는?\n\n     ①                          \n\n② \n\n     ③                          \n       ④                                         \n                 ⑤                                ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":781},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":653}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n원점에 125nC의 전하가 있을 때, 점(3, 4, 0)에서의\n\n                            \n전계는 몇 Vm인가? (단,    × 이다.)                                 \n\n①        ② \n③       ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":587},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":482}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanat