ion":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n\n전속밀도가        pCm인 균등전계\n\n내에서 점(1, 2, 3)을 중심으로 하는 m의 구 내부의\n\n전하는 몇 pC인가?\n\n\n① 3           ② 6\n\n③ 9           ④ 12\n\n⑤ 15","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":657},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n전위가 V일 때, 점(1, 1, 4)에서의 전계의\n\n세기는 몇 Vm인가?\n\n                     ①     ② \n③    ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":595},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":479}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n비유전율이 6인 운모를 채운 평행판 콘덴서의 극판\n\n단면적이 1m, 극판간격이 1mm일 때, 이 콘덴서의\n\n정전용량은 몇 F인가?\n\n\n① ×        ② × \n③ ×        ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":631},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m44-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n\n1C의 전하가 균등전계                  Vm 및 자계\nm내에서 ms로 운동하고 있을\n\n때, 점전하에 작용하는 힘은 몇 N인가?\n\n①       ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m45-q.webp","width":696,"height":650},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m45-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n정전계의 자유공간상에 존재하는 도체의 어떤 점에 대한\n                  전계가                  nVm일 때, 이 점의 \n면전하밀도 는 몇 pCm인가?\n\n\n① 100         ② 200\n\n③ 300         ④ 400\n\n⑤ 500","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m46-q.webp","width":696,"height":654},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m46-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1047}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P046-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\n전기력선에 관한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 전기력선은 도체표면과 수직으로 작용한다.\n\n② 전기력선은 등전위면과 수평으로 작용한다.\n\n③ 전기력선 밀도는 전계의 세기와 같다.\n\n④ 한 점에서의 전기력선 방향은 그 점에서의 전계의 방향\n\n  과 같다.\n\n⑤ 전기력선은 전위가 높은 점에서 낮은 점으로 향한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e05-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m47-q.webp","width":696,"height":579},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e05-m47-e1.webp","width":696,"height":835}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
